Kind: api_key_created
Locale: en
From: <noreply@tanvo.test>
Reply-To: 
To: 
Cc: 
Bcc: <admin@hooli.test>
Subject: A new Tanvo API key has been created

==== text
Hello,

A new API key has been successfully created for your organization, Hooli & Co.

If someone from your team initiated this, you can start using this API key to automate your billing process.

However, if you did not authorize this change, please reset your password and delete the API key immediately to protect your account.

--
You're receiving this email because a new API key has been created in your Tanvo instance, and you have admin privileges.

